   "summary": "Welcome to the SRE Interview Prep path of the Interstitium Labs SRE, DevOps, Cloud & Security Interview Prep course. I'm your instructor for this path, and we open with the vocabulary every SRE interview runs on: what to measure, what target to promise, and what happens when the budget burns. This is Module 1: SLIs, SLOs, and Error Budgets. By the end, you'll choose SLIs from the four golden signals, do error-budget arithmetic on a whiteboard, and explain burn-rate alerting the way someone who has carried a pager explains it — in terms of paging policy, not poetry.",
