   "summary": "Welcome back. I'm your instructor for the SRE Interview Prep path, and this is Module 3: Monitoring, Tracing, and Alerting. Observability is an interview topic that separates people who have watched dashboards from people who have designed them. We cover the three pillars, the four golden signals, the USE and RED lenses, and the alerting philosophy that keeps you from paging yourself to death. By the end you'll design an alerting policy aloud — what pages, what tickets, and why — which is exactly what the monitoring round is really asking.",
