    "id": "sre-interview-prep--sre-capacity--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: Capacity Planning and Scaling",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Capacity Planning and Scaling — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
