   "summary": "Welcome back. I'm your instructor for the SRE Interview Prep path, and this is Module 4: Capacity Planning and Scaling. Capacity interviews are applied arithmetic with a cost conscience: forecast the demand, prove it with load tests, provision headroom against the utilization wall, and narrate the price of every extra nine. In this module you'll do the worked math — headroom, N+1, autoscaling lag — and learn to say the interview line that matters: 'I plan headroom against the wall, not against the average.'",
