   "summary": "Welcome to the DevOps Engineering Interview Prep path of the Interstitium Labs SRE, DevOps, Cloud & Security Interview Prep course. I'm your instructor for this path, and we start with the artifact DevOps interviews are really about: the pipeline. CI stages in fail-fast order, immutable artifacts, deployment strategies by blast-radius tolerance, and the rollback plan that proves you have shipped before. This is Module 1: CI/CD Systems. By the end you'll design a pipeline aloud — stages, gates, strategies — and defend every choice like someone who has been paged by a bad deploy.",
