   "summary": "Welcome back. I'm your instructor for the DevOps Interview Prep path, and this is Module 2: Infrastructure as Code Patterns. IaC interviews probe three topics that separate users from operators: state, modules, and drift. Declarative vs imperative, the Terraform plan-apply loop with remote state and locking, flat module composition, drift detection, and policy-as-code at plan time. You'll leave able to whiteboard a Terraform workflow and explain why plan-before-apply is non-negotiable.",
