   "summary": "Welcome back. I'm your instructor for the DevOps Interview Prep path, and this is Module 5: Guided Platform Build. Now we build the artifact: a portfolio-grade platform — repo scaffold with app plus Dockerfile, VPC via Terraform, scripted cluster bootstrap, CI pipeline, GitOps deploy with Argo CD — documented well enough to walk an interviewer through. Platforms have customers, and their API is documentation: runbooks, ADRs, onboarding docs. You'll ship all three.",
