   "summary": "Welcome back. I'm your instructor for the DevOps Interview Prep path, and this is Module 6: DevOps Mock Circuit. The full DevOps loop simulated: a pipeline-design round, a live troubleshooting round, and the behavioral round where ops stories win offers. STAR for ops, questions that reveal the job's reality, and offer-negotiation basics. You'll run the circuit timed, score it against a rubric, and turn the weakest round into next week's plan.",
