       "answer": "AZs: isolated failure domains in a region (power, network). Regions: geographic separation for disasters and compliance. The interview line: ‘AZs survive rack failures; regions survive hurricanes.’",
       "explain": "Core recall for this module. If this wasn't fluent, re-read the 'Concepts' note and retry until it is."
      },
