       "prompt": "From memory, in one or two sentences: What do interviewers probe in elasticity vs scalability?",
       "answer": "Scalability: handling more load. Elasticity: scaling up AND down automatically with demand — the cloud’s distinctive trick. The interview line: ‘elasticity is scalability with a down arrow.’",
       "explain": "Core recall for this module. If this wasn't fluent, re-read the 'Concepts' note and retry until it is."
