   "summary": "Welcome to the Cloud Engineering Interview Prep path of the Interstitium Labs SRE, DevOps, Cloud & Security Interview Prep course. I'm your instructor for this path, and we begin with the conceptual floor every cloud interview stands on: what the cloud is, who secures what, and when each compute primitive wins. Regions, AZs, edge; the shared-responsibility model; VMs, containers, serverless; CapEx vs OpEx — told honestly. This is Module 1: Core Cloud Concepts. You'll leave leading with vendor-neutral concepts, because concepts transfer and click-paths don't.",
