    "id": "cloud-interview-prep--cloud-data--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: Data and Storage Services",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Data and Storage Services — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
