    "id": "cloud-interview-prep--cloud-arch-build--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: Guided Cloud Architecture",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Guided Cloud Architecture — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
     "Write a blameless incident review for a realistic Guided Cloud Architecture failure: timeline, impact in numbers, detection, response, root cause, action items with owners.",
     "Specify the SLOs: indicators, objectives, error budget, and what consumes the budget — with the math shown.",
     "Draw the architecture and annotate every tradeoff: what you chose, what you gave up, why it was worth it.",
     "Write the runbook excerpt: the alert, the first five diagnostic commands, the escalation path.",
