    "id": "security-eng-interview-prep--sec-appsec--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: Application Security Fundamentals",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Application Security Fundamentals — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
     "Write a blameless incident review for a realistic Application Security Fundamentals failure: timeline, impact in numbers, detection, response, root cause, action items with owners.",
