    "id": "security-eng-interview-prep--sec-network--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: Network Security in Practice",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Network Security in Practice — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
