    "title": "Operator's brief: Secure Design Review",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for Secure Design Review — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
     "Write a blameless incident review for a realistic Secure Design Review failure: timeline, impact in numbers, detection, response, root cause, action items with owners.",
