    "id": "tech-mock-interview-circuit--mock-sysdesign--lab",
    "title": "Operator's brief: System Design Reps",
    "brief": "You will write the artifacts a real operator would produce for System Design Reps — incident review, SLO spec, and tradeoff analysis — because interviews probe the seams.",
    "steps": [
